  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Institutional Capacity for e-Government</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Serbian Government requested the Bank support in strengthening the monitoring and evaluation (M&amp;E) system of the e-Government program. This IDF would finance the assessment of the current status of the e-Government action plan to identify possible improvements for capacity building, implementation of e-Gov program at central and local levels, finding ways for optimal use of available infrastructure, assessment of the feasibility of using open-source solutions in public sector and developing a results-based M&amp;E system for eGov program. In addition, there will be related dissemination and learning activities. The results of these studies will be shared with relevant stakeholders at the end of the assignment. TF096230 The Development Objective of this IDF is to provide strategic guidance on institutional strengthening and capacity building support to the Ministry of Telecommunications and Information Society for implementation of recently adopted e-Government Strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
